  "notes": "{現|あらわ}れる means to appear or emerge, used for people, symptoms, results, etc.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive)\n- Pair: {現|あらわ}す (transitive, to reveal/show)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {人|ひと}が{現|あらわ}れる: a person appears\n- {症状|しょうじょう}が{現|あらわ}れる: symptoms appear\n- {結果|けっか}が{現|あらわ}れる: results show\n- {効果|こうか}が{現|あらわ}れる: effects appear\n\nALTERNATE KANJI:\nSometimes written as {表|あらわ}れる (same meaning).\n\nSIMILAR:\n- {出|で}る: to come out\n- {見|み}える: to be visible",
